  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "ERECTION OF A PART SINGLE PART TWO STOREY REAR EXTENSION",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot; arial&quot;,sans-serif;=&quot;&quot; mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:=&quot;&quot; calibri;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;=&quot;&quot; mso-bidi-language:ar-sa&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;The proposed first floor rear extension, by reason of\r\nits combined siting, design, width, height and depth results in a visually intrusive, dominant and\r\ndisproportionate form of development that would fail to respect the character, appearance\r\nand proportions of the host dwelling and terrace row that it forms a part of. The proposal is therefore\r\ncontrary to, in particular, Policies D3 and D4 of the London Plan (2021) and Policies D12.1 and\r\nD12.2 of the Merton Local Plan (2024)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
